ata-end=\"287\">VOLTA Football</strong>, waarin je straatvoetbal speelt in kleine teams op verschillende locaties wereldwijd.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"504\">Speel carrièremodus, bouw je eigen team in <strong data-start=\"418\" data-end=\"440\">FIFA Ultimate Team</strong>, of neem het op tegen vrienden in lokale of online wedstrijden.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"521\"><strong data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"521\">✅ Kenmerken</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"681\">\r\n<li data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"550\">\r\n<p data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"550\">Platform: PlayStation 4</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"577\">\r\n<p data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"577\">Genre: Sport / Voetbal</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"618\">\r\n<p data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"618\">Spelmodi: Singleplayer & Multiplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"669\">\r\n<p data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"669\">Inclusief: VOLTA Football (straatvoetbalmodus)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"681\">\r\n<p data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"681\">PEGI: 3</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"704\"><strong data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"704\">📦 Staat & inhoud</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"808\">\r\n<li data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"728\">\r\n<p data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"728\">Staat: Goede staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"747\">\r\n<p data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"747\">Originele disc</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"777\">\r\n<p data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"777\">Originele doos inbegrepen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"808\">\r\n<p data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"808\">Getest en volledig werkend</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"825\"><strong data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"825\">🛡 Garantie</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"915\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Bij aankoop ontvang je <strong data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"862\">garantie</strong> op het product. Zo kun je met een gerust hart gamen.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>",
